title Cassette MERGE TAKES on the recordings list: the five keys (LOAD, RENAME, EDIT, MERGE, DELETE); M enters merge mode with the selected take as number 1 (the takes that cannot join it dimmed with the reason); Enter drops it (nothing chosen: every take can be chosen) and chooses it again; three takes chosen in an order (006, 007, 004); M opens the merge box; DELETE ORIGINALS asks first (Esc goes back to the box); KEEP ORIGINALS shows the progress box; Esc stops the merge; a tap on a dimmed take says why; Esc leaves merge mode
sizes 480x480
ppmm 667
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
expect text "LOAD"
expect text "RENAME"
expect text "EDIT"
expect text "MERGE"
expect text "DELETE"
shot list-keys
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key m
wait 300
expect text "CANCEL"
expect text "Different format: FLAC 44.1 kHz"
expect notext "RENAME"
shot mode-1
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Different format: FLAC 44.1 kHz"
expect text "Merge · 0 takes"
shot mode-0
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key enter
wait 200
key up
wait 200
key enter
wait 200
key down
key down
key down
wait 200
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Merge · 3 takes · 13:31 · about 77 MB"
expect text "Different format: FLAC 44.1 kHz"
shot mode-3
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key m
wait 300
expect text "Merge 3 takes?"
expect text "take_008_20261111-1502.wav"
expect text "13:31 · about 77 MB"
expect text "KEEP ORIGINALS"
shot merge-box
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
tap "DELETE ORIGINALS"
wait 300
expect text "Delete the originals?"
expect text "They are deleted only after the new file is written and synced."
shot confirm-delete-originals
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Delete the originals?"
expect text "KEEP ORIGINALS"
say Esc answered no: the merge box stays
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Merging... 37%"
expect text "3 takes into take_008_20261111-1502.wav"
shot progress
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Merging... 37%"
expect text "Merge cancelled"
shot cancelled
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
tap "Different format: FLAC 44.1 kHz"
wait 300
expect text "Not available: Different format: FLAC 44.1 kHz"
say a tap on a dimmed take says why and chooses nothing
key esc
wait 300
expect text "RENAME"
expect notext "Different format: FLAC 44.1 kHz"
key esc
wait 300
expect text "SOFT"
expect noquit
